    {
      "id": "workflow-question-class-landing",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Question contract",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 490
      },
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workflow-question-class"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Question · Workflow class\n\nA first-class problem statement, independent of its executing workflow. Define the question, answer kind, JSON answer schema, required evidence, completion criterion and unresolved response. A Workflow binds one Question through `questionId`. The preflight validates the binding and answer contract, but does not verify real answers.\n\nA completed sequence is not automatically a resolved question. Answer outcomes are `resolved`, `unresolved`, or `blocked` and belong to each run record."
        }
      }
    },
